CLASS net/minecraft/class_1_1874 net/minecraft/util/codegen/MonomorphizableDelegate
	COMMENT The superclass for classes that can be monomorphized.
	COMMENT
	COMMENT A class that extends {@code MonomorphizableDelegate} is called a
	COMMENT <i>delegate class</i>. This class must implement the interface
	COMMENT {@code Interface}, which also has a substantial implementation {@code Target}
	COMMENT (the <i>target class</i>). The delegate class wraps an instance of the
	COMMENT target class, and its implementation of the interface methods should
	COMMENT forward to the target’s implementation.
	COMMENT
	COMMENT In the context of this class, monomorphization entails creating a copy of
	COMMENT the target class so that instances of the target class can be converted
	COMMENT into instances of hidden classes where the target instance’s record
	COMMENT components are inlined into the method definitions (using class data).
	COMMENT When a {@code MonomorphizableDelegate} is instantiated with a new target
	COMMENT class, the bytecode for a monomorphic version of the target class is
	COMMENT generated. The resulting class implements {@link GeneratedDelegate}.
	COMMENT
	COMMENT @param Interface an interface type, which the delegate class must implement.
	COMMENT @param Target a type of a class that implements {@code Interface}. Must be
	COMMENT               a non-hidden record class with no non-static interfaces and no
	COMMENT               {@code super} method calls.
	FIELD field_1_12106 MONOMORPH_CACHE Ljava/util/concurrent/ConcurrentMap;
	FIELD field_1_12107 monomorph Lnet/minecraft/class_1_1880;
	FIELD field_1_12108 target Ljava/lang/Object;
